	(text "Decoupling per UG-637: 100 nF + 10 nF at each supply pin, same side as U1, via under the 100 nF pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ab87c73-4504-4783-b83e-80acc166e361")
	)
	(text "Analog input (UG-637 Fig. 9): 75 R termination (R1+R2), gain 0.7, AC coupled by C1.\nCVBS_IN is driven by THS7314 CH1 through R9 (75 R) across the breakaway tab; when split: J8 -> coax -> J2, D1 = ESD at J2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e563dd02-247f-49bc-a747-b44089834dd6")
	)
	(text "Crystal 28.63636 MHz, fundamental, CL 20 pF:\nC = 2(CL-Cs)-Cpg = 2(20-3)-4 = 30 pF -> 27 pF (AN-1260)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "28134a49-2d6c-47bf-b659-e4c3bda44cec")
	)
	(text "MIPI CSI-2, 1 data lane + clock (216 Mbps interlaced / 432 Mbps I2P).\nRoute as 100 R differential (2 x 50 R loosely coupled per UG-637), GND plane under; P/N crossover: both lines 2 vias + GND return vias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e580579f-bcac-4176-b5b8-a591fd1c0e75")
	)
	(text "THS7314 BUFFER STAGE (rev C: breakaway section, SPRUT-2 case)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 58.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bce46706-5cd0-4651-981a-cca0c0099d73")
	)
	(text "5 V from the case DC-DC 5 V module via J4 (solder pads); the Pi 4 is powered from the same module. The decoder itself runs from the Pi 3.3 V (J1 pin 15).\nPanel BNC -> coax -> J5 -> buffer: CH1 -> decoder, CH2 -> J6 TV (AV in), CH3 -> J7 GX16 monitor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0b73e2f1-d97e-4680-8917-eed5c9e1982f")
	)
	(text "Power: J4 -> D2 SS14 (reverse polarity, -0.4 V) -> C28 22 uF -> FB2 -> C27 10 uF + C26 100 nF at VS+ (SLOS513A: 0.1 uF at the pin, 22-100 uF on the line).\nTHS7314 runs from 3 to 5 V; at ~4.6 V the output swing (4.5 V typ into 75 R) leaves >2 V margin for 2 Vpp video + 0.29 V clamp offset. No LDO needed. Iq 17 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ac748835-b027-4f85-88e8-49f743b8c88b")
	)
	(text "Input (SLOS513A Fig. 33/34): R8 75 R termination, D3 ESD, C23-C25 100 nF series -> sync-tip clamp (DC restore) mode, one cap per input (each input has its own clamp).\nOutputs: gain 6 dB (x2), series 75 R into 75 R load -> unity overall. CH1 -> decoder (R1+R2 = 73 R load), CH2/CH3 -> J6 TV / J7 GX16. Bandwidth 8.5 MHz (5th-order LPF)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c0b1daa2-3060-48b3-8410-19c4a83b8c65")
	)
